        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern notes"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Shell: 5 tr in same st. Right-side row: ch 3, * dc in top of shell (3rd tr), ch 2, shell in dc; rep, dc in top of t-ch. Wrong-side row: ch 3, * shell in dc, ch 2, dc in 3rd tr of shell; rep, end tr in t-ch."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 50 (6 shell repeats, approx. 40 cm wide). Row 1 (right side): shell in 4th ch from hook, * skip 4, dc in next ch, skip 4, shell in next ch; rep, skip 4, dc in last ch. Turn. (5 shells)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 2 (wrong side): ch 3, * "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "shell-l6"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "shell"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in dc, ch 2, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc-spacer-l6"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc spacer"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in 3rd tr of shell; rep. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 3 (right side): ch 3, dc in first shell, * ch 2, shell in dc, ch 2, dc in shell; rep, end tr in t-ch. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat rows 2 and 3 for 160 cm length (approx. 96 rows) or until yarn is nearly used."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fasten off. Weave in ends. Wet the shawl and pin to full dimensions. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "blocking-l6"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Blocking"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " opens the shells. Leave flat until dry."
          }
        ]
      },
